    <node id="&quot;OBITUARY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Obituary is a band mentioned as the origin of the guitarist Allen West, who later joined Six Feet Under (band) as a founding member."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALLEN WEST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Allen West is a guitarist who was originally part of Obituary and later joined Six Feet Under (band) as a founding member."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANNIBAL CORPSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cannibal Corpse is a band mentioned as the reason for Chris Barnes leaving to form Six Feet Under (band) full-time after being dismissed in 1995."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150</data>
    </node>
