    <node id="&quot;TAMIL NADU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tamil Nadu is the state in India where the film Manorama Six Feet Under (film) is set, as it is a small sleepy town in Rajasthan, which is a fictionalized version of a real town in Tamil Nadu."</data>
